  m_Name: SavingPrivateSayori
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428570
    - rid: 4972360205905428571
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Let''s start with the most important question:'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428572
    - rid: 4972360205905428573
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: Where are the others?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I don't know what you're talking about, what others?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428574
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: Don't play coy with me!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428575
    - rid: 4972360475574796534
    - rid: 4972360205905428577
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: The other Talos worshippers, we know that there's more of them in Morthal.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428578
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: Where are they hiding?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm telling you, I don't know! I don't even live there-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428580
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: <NoiseText=3,1>Kyaa</NoiseText>-!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428579
    - rid: 4972360205905428581
    - rid: 4972360475574796535
    - rid: 4972360475574796536
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: For not giving him the answer he wanted, the Justiciar stabbed a small
      knife into Sayori's diaphram.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428584
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: Foolish girl! If that's not the case, then-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: -?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428585
    - rid: 4972360475574796537
    - rid: 4972360205905428587
    - rid: 4972360390599770185
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: Odd... I don't remember any reports of an incoming storm...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: Anyway, if you don't want this knife to spill out your intestines, you
      had better tell me where they are.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428588
    - rid: 4972360205905428589
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ... <NoiseText=1,1>B-b-but I don't know</NoiseText>...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428590
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: Fine. Be that way.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428591
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: I can see that you'll need more... <i>convincing</i>.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428592
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428593
    - rid: 4972360205905428594
    - rid: 4972360205905428596
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 491799c9d5b8c2649bb20546f506fa86, type: 2}
    dialog: Woof!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796538
    - rid: 4972360205905428597
    - rid: 4972360205905428598
    - rid: 4972360205905428600
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (Alright, the front seems to be guarded, how best should I approach this?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428601
    - rid: 4972360205905428603
    - rid: 4972360205905428604
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428605
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428606
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428609
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428613
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (-?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428614
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (Now that I say that...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (I've got a pretty good idea.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428615
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (No thanks to <b>you</b>.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428616
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Meeko, you're gonna have to sit tight back here.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428617
    - rid: 4972360205905428618
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: This place is gonna become a warzone, no place for a good boy like you.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428619
    - rid: 4972360205905428620
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So, whatever you do, don't go past these rocks.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428621
    - rid: 4972360205905428622
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Listening to {mc}'s instructions, like the good boy he is, Meeko lies
      down.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428623
    - rid: 4972360205905428624
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Good, now then...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428625
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <font=dragonfont>od 4 v3ng</font>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428626
    - rid: 4972360475574796539
    - rid: 4972360390599770188
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428628
    - rid: 4972360205905428629
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: <font=dragonfont>od 4 v3ng</font>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428630
    - rid: 4972360205905428631
    - rid: 4972360475574796540
    - rid: 4972360390599770189
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: What in Oblivion was that?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (That... that was {mc}! That's his voice!)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e29da807434d3ee4d93a1bd54792c5dc, type: 2}
    dialog: Sir, sir!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428633
    - rid: 4972360205905428634
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: What?!? Can't you see that I'm busy-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428635
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e29da807434d3ee4d93a1bd54792c5dc, type: 2}
    dialog: A dragon just landed outside of the fort, what do we do?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: A dragon?!?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: Auriel preserve us...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796541
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm going to command the troops, you escort this prisoner back to her
      cell- don't want her getting crafty while we're gone.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e29da807434d3ee4d93a1bd54792c5dc, type: 2}
    dialog: Yes sir.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428636
    - rid: 4972360205905428637
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Odahviing lands nearby {mc}.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428638
    - rid: 4972360475574796542
    - rid: 4972360205905428641
    - rid: 4972360390599770190
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0c7e6e02081ef145a5f9d29590789ea, type: 2}
    dialog: I have answered your call, why have you summoned me?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You remember how I said it was fine to harass the elves of Summerset?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428642
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0c7e6e02081ef145a5f9d29590789ea, type: 2}
    dialog: Indeed. I suspect this has something to do with that?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428643
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You see that fort over there?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428644
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0c7e6e02081ef145a5f9d29590789ea, type: 2}
    dialog: That pitiful structure? Yes, I do.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428645
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm going to be heading in there for a bit, what I want you to do is
      roast every single High Elf you find and try to lead them away from here.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428646
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0c7e6e02081ef145a5f9d29590789ea, type: 2}
    dialog: ... If you insist.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428647
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Odahviing takes flight once more, accosting the elves with the might
      of his thu'um.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796543
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428650
    - rid: 4972360205905428653
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e29da807434d3ee4d93a1bd54792c5dc, type: 2}
    dialog: You should consider yourself lucky. That dragon's put off your interrogation
      for a bit.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428652
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: With that last pointlessly cruel remark, the Thalmor soldier goes to
      join his ranks in combatting Odahviing.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Are they all gone...?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428654
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori tries to listen to the movement of the soldiers; the few left
      in the building all seem to be going outside, away from her.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Alright.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428655
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: With no elven witnesses, Sayori starts healing the wounds she got from
      the Justiciar.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428656
    - rid: 4972360205905428657
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (The coast should be clear now-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428665
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: -!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428659
    - rid: 4972360205905428660
    - rid: 4972360205905428661
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (Okay, <i>now</i> it should be clear.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428662
    - rid: 4972360205905428663
    - rid: 4972360205905428664
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428666
    - rid: 4972360205905428667
    - rid: 4972360205905428668
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc} finds the entrance to Northwatch sparse of any Thalmor-'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Probably because they would be first out of the door to go fight a dragon.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428669
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: When passing through this room, {mc} picks up a bottle of wine and starts
      drinking it rapidly.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428670
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (What? I haven't had anything to drink all day; can't do a jailbreak
      while parched.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428671
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428672
    - rid: 4972360205905428673
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428674
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: In a similar vein to his wine-snatching, {mc} takes a loaf of bread from
      a plate and starts eating as he makes his way through the fort.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428675
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Not even a minute of fighting and we're already down five men?!?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428677
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc} is able to hear what sounds like some sort of elven official complaining
      about casualties up the stairs.'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428678
    - rid: 4972360205905428679
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: I could've sworn Elenwyn said she looking into this matter-!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428680
    - rid: 4972360205905428681
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: What're you doing up here, hiding like a coward? Aren't you supposed
      to be leading your men?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428682
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: Wha- who are you?!? Who let you-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428683
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Oh, I understand now. '
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: You are but a primitive ape seeking shelter from the mighty beast, no?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, you shall find no welcome here-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Ahahaha... no, no...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428684
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Tell me, where're you keeping Sayori.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428685
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: ... Sayori?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428686
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm not sure if I know of anyone named Sayori.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I know you've got her holed up in her somewhere, I swear if you've hurt
      her-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428687
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, the <i>audacity</i>! I assure you, every single one of our prisoners
      are legally detained, we have full rights to-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428688
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Okay, I've had enough of you, elf.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428689
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc} draws his Dwarven sword, the Justiciar, noting the threat, raises
      his spells in response.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428690
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428691
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428692
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428694
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
