  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428698
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The Justiciar tries to maintain his distance to blast a bolt of lightning
      at {mc}-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: But he's unable to-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428701
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: <NoiseText=3,1>Graaaah</NoiseText>-!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428702
    - rid: 4972360475574796544
    - rid: 4972360205905428706
    - rid: 4972360475574796545
    - rid: 4972360213072445518
    - rid: 4972360390599770192
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc} uses the Whirlwind Sprint shout to effectively joust the Justiciar
      without a horse-'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428704
    - rid: 4972360205905428705
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Which takes out a large portion of the Justiciar's torso.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The Justiciar tries to use the last of his strength to mount some sort
      of attack at {mc}-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: But {mc} quickly beheads the Justiciar, stopping him in his tracks.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428708
    - rid: 4972360205905428709
    - rid: 4972360475574796546
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (Okay, if I was Sayori, where would I be...?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428715
    - rid: 4972360205905428716
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (... a good adventurer always goes left.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428717
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428718
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (Nope. No Sayori in the torture chamber.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (That's good, I guess-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428719
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (... fresh blood on the equipment...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428720
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Since the torture room is a dead end, {mc} turns around heading into
      the hallway that was to his right.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428724
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428722
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428723
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}! I''m in here!'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428725
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, let's see if we can't-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428726
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Locked. Well, duh.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428727
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright Sayori, I'm gonna need you to hug the wall as hard as you can.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428728
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Huh? It's pretty hard to hug a wall, you can't wrap your arms around
      it at all-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428729
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I meant I need you to stay as close to the wall as possible, preferably
      flat up against it.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428730
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, ehehe...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428731
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori does as she was told, flattening herself against the wall.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Um, why am I-?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428732
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <font=dragonfont>fus ro d4</font>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428733
    - rid: 4972360475574796547
    - rid: 4972360390599770196
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc} unleashes an Unrelenting Force shout, trying to aim it at the door.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428735
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Which despite being made up of a bunch of bars, snaps off of its hinges
      and slams the wall across from {mc}.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428736
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Eek-!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428737
    - rid: 4972360205905428738
    - rid: 4972360205905428739
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: C'mon, let's go.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428740
    - rid: 4972360205905428741
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, okay!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428742
    - rid: 4972360205905428743
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428744
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Meeko's waiting for us just behind those rocks-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428745
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Meeko?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428746
    - rid: 4972360205905428747
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: The dog, I thought you met him?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428748
    - rid: 4972360205905428749
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, is that his name?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428750
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360205905428751
    - rid: 4972360205905428752
    - rid: 4972360205905428753
